    "turn_text": "yeah i mean you know i'm really proud the last two congresses i have been ranked in the proper uh... ten percent of the most bipartisan uh... members of congress and most bipartisan member of congress in ohio i go out of my way to find things that I agree with with other people, you know, and how do we work together on those issues? And I just think it's got to start seeing each other as Americans. Where there's too much Democrat, Republican, red shirt, blue shirt. We're all Americans. Let's all put on the red, white and blue shirt and go out and play on Team USA. We've got to out compete, Chinese, just set electric vehicles there at 52%. of the electric vehicle markets done in China. China wants us fighting with each other. Russia wants us fighting with each other because the more we're fighting with each other, the weaker we are. And so if we're going to rebuild the great American middle class, it's got to be us. seeing each other's americans first then moving on to okay you have a democrat idea or but you know republican idea let's have a conversation let's talk like adults and that's that's my worry quite frankly with with a guy like jd vance who's who got nominated on the other side i mean he he's ready to punish half the country that doesn't agree with them You know, and so I'm not like that at all. I mean, I'm the complete opposite. I'll work with Dave Joyce is the Republican up north and in Ohio on the Great Lakes. issues. I work with a very, very conservative Republican from Florida to try to bring back pharmaceutical manufacturing. 90% of generic pharmaceuticals, excuse me, are done in China. We got to bring that back. So I'll go out of my way to find things to work out with other people. And he wants to punish people and make this a Democrat Republican thing. I just don't think Ohio is there.",
