    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49422.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Tim, I find a question for you this morning and then I'll let you go. Kind enough for you to join us for a few minutes. As you mentioned, the war and certainly Vladimir Putin and the war crimes has been hung over his head for a while. You've been on many security committees through your career in our nation's capital. How are you particularly looking at this war in the Ukraine right now?",
